---
description: torrex_core must stay Qt-free; engine thread owns libtorrent
globs: "{src/core/**,include/torrex/**}"
alwaysApply: false
---

# torrex_core boundaries

- Never `#include` Qt headers in `src/core/` or `include/torrex/`.
- All `libtorrent::session` and `torrent_handle` use stays on the worker thread inside `SessionManager`.
- UI and QML communicate via `TorrentCommand` queue and `TorrentSnapshot` value types only.
- Public API lives in `include/torrex/` only.
